# 🎨 PRETTIER SCOPE (issue #55)
# Prettier formats the code: TypeScript, JavaScript and JSON config. The style lives in
# .prettierrc.json and matches the code as it was written (single quotes, semicolons, no trailing
# commas, 120 columns). Run `npm run format` to apply it and `npm run format:check` to verify it.
#
# Left out on purpose:
# - Markdown: the remediation log and SECURITY.md are written by hand with CRLF line endings and wide
#   tables, and README.md is partly generated (scripts/sync-readme.mjs); reflowing them would only
#   create noise in the history.
# - YAML: openapi.yaml, the workflows, docker-compose.yml and the k8s manifests are reviewed line by
#   line, and their layout is part of that review.
*.md
*.yml
*.yaml

# Generated or installed files.
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
package-lock.json
frontend/.next/
frontend/next-env.d.ts
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

